# Accepted risks for the Trivy gate in .github/workflows/ci.yml. Every entry
# names where it comes from and expires, so the gate re-asks the question.

# cli-builder only: brace-expansion 5.0.9 and undici 6.28.0 bundled inside npm
# (both /usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm and semantic-release's own npm). No npm
# release ships the fixed versions yet -- npm 12.2.0 and 11.21.0 both still
# bundle these. DoS-only, reachable through crafted brace patterns or a hostile
# WebSocket server, neither of which npm itself feeds them. Drop once an npm
# release bundles brace-expansion >= 5.0.11 and undici >= 6.28.1.
